| **Place ID** | `ChIJ2eUgeAK6j4ARbn5u_wAGqWA` |
| **Location Type** | `ROOFTOP` (exact building location) |
| **Latitude** | `37.4224764` |
| **Longitude** | `-122.0842499` |

